WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.719
Jack walked along the road.

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:12.487
Near the ogre's house, he ducked behind a bush.

3
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:19.768
He waited until the ogre's wife came out.

4
00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:27.215
She carried a pail.

5
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:31.257
"She's going to the well for water," Jack thought.

6
00:00:31.258 --> 00:00:45.369
He waited another minute. "Now!"

7
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:52.349
He slipped into the house.

8
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:55.456
He spotted a large copper tub.

9
00:00:55.457 --> 00:01:00.104
It was filled with laundry.

10
00:01:00.105 --> 00:01:04.862
Jack climbed under the clothes.

11
00:01:04.863 --> 00:01:09.583
Soon he heard a sound.

12
00:01:09.584 --> 00:01:18.518
Thump! Thump! Thump!

13
00:01:18.519 --> 00:01:23.181
The ogre sniffed the air.

14
00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:28.770
He stomped around the room.

15
00:01:28.771 --> 00:01:33.284
"Fee, fi, fo, fum!" the ogre cried.

16
00:01:33.285 --> 00:01:37.570
"I smell an English boy!"

17
00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:48.936
The ogre sniffed all around.

18
00:01:48.937 --> 00:01:52.215
His wife hurried into the house.

19
00:01:52.216 --> 00:01:56.062
"What are you doing?" she asked.

20
00:01:56.063 --> 00:02:04.094
"I smell him! I know I do!" the ogre shouted.

21
00:02:04.095 --> 00:02:06.632
The ogre's wife stared at him.

22
00:02:06.633 --> 00:02:11.177
"You smell that boy?" she asked.

23
00:02:11.178 --> 00:02:15.001
"The one who stole your gold?"

24
00:02:15.002 --> 00:02:18.069
"Yes!" The ogre growled.

25
00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.055
His eyes burned with anger.

26
00:02:21.056 --> 00:02:24.936
"He stole my golden hen too!"

27
00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:33.707
"I know where the boy is!" the ogre’s wife said.

28
00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:38.712
She ran to the oven and threw open the door.

29
00:02:38.713 --> 00:02:43.816
But Jack wasn't there!

30
00:02:43.817 --> 00:02:49.478
The ogre stamped his foot.

31
00:02:49.479 --> 00:02:54.805
"I smell him!" he shouted.

32
00:02:54.806 --> 00:03:01.559
"That boy is around here somewhere!"

